# Engineering decisions log

When a change adds or alters rate limits, account or privacy rules, authentication, email behavior, or server-side game enforcement, update `Docs/engineering-decisions.md` in the same change.

Write that file in English. State the rule, where it is enforced, and what it does not cover. Do not leave the doc describing behavior the code no longer has.
